---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About Me";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <p>
    I'm a backend developer, engineer manager living in Da Nang, Vietnam.
    I'm currently taking a gap, building fun things just for the sake of it.
  </p>

  <p>
    I studied and worked in the U.S. for about 10 years.
    Then I decided to move back to Vietnam.
    The main reason was for my mental health.
  </p>

  <p>
    I was CTO of <a href="https://www.byterover.dev/">ByteRover</a> for almost a year,
    then left the company in 06/2026.
  </p>

  <p>
    I used to play guitar semi-professionally.
    The money wasn't much but it was an extremely fun ride.
    Ever since I moved back to Vietnam,
    I haven't touched my Strandberg Boden and my rig.
    They got pretty dusty and probably hated me for it.
    I do plan to get serious with music again in the future.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

